<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.description>参与者将在{MOODDAYS}天内获得{MINMOOD}到{MAXMOOD}的心情值，这取决于仪式的效果。</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.description>
  <!-- EN: shaman psyker level -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.comps.0.label>演讲者的启灵等级</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!-- EN: deceased psychic sensitivity -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.comps.1.label>死者的心灵敏感度</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.comps.2.label>参与者数量</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {RITUAL} was spectacular! {CORPSE} has been absorbed and the anima tree has empowered us. -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.modExtensions.0.bestOutcomeDesc>{RITUAL}非常完美！{CORPSE}的灵魂得到了安息，仙树之灵也赐予了我们力量。</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.modExtensions.0.bestOutcomeDesc>
  <!-- EN: The {RITUAL} was a disaster! {CORPSE}'s soul angered the tree! -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.modExtensions.0.worstOutcomeDesc>{RITUAL}糟糕透顶！{CORPSE}的灵魂触怒了仙树之灵！</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.modExtensions.0.worstOutcomeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Terrible -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label> 
  <!-- EN: The {0} was terrible! We have angered the tree's spirit and it's punishing us. -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}非常糟糕！我们触怒了仙树之灵，它会对我们降下责罚的！</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Lackluster -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>枯燥乏味的</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was lackluster. We fear we may have offended the tree spirit -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0}枯燥乏味。我们很担心这会触怒仙树之灵。</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!-- EN: Good -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>令人满意的</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was good. Our friend belongs to the tree spirit now. -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}令人满意。我们的朋友现在与仙树之灵同在了。</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!-- EN: Amazing -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>令人惊异的</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was great. The tree's spirit appears pleased, and grass has grown. -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}令人惊异！仙树之灵似乎很满意，附近的灵草也长得更茂盛了。</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!-- EN: Incredible -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.4.label>难以忘怀的</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.4.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was breathtaking. The tree's spirit has graced us with some of its power. -->
  <AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.4.description>{0}难以忘怀！仙树之灵为我们赐予了一些力量。</AM_AnimaBurialOutcome.outcomeChances.4.description>
  
</LanguageData>